usage: evaluate_real_voice.py [-h] --corpus CORPUS --output OUTPUT --model
                              MODEL --values VALUES [--resume]

Evaluate immutable real-voice inputs; never interpret paired NLP as gold
labels. Run with ``python -m tools.evaluate_real_voice --help``. Each output
directory is exclusive: completed cases are durable, and --resume verifies
input identity.

options:
